	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg17482"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1104" title="View the profile of Greif">Greif</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 2<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/02-roll.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1104"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.cold-fury.net" title="Cold Fury" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg17482#msg17482"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg17482#msg17482">Re: Top Ten Quellious/Rodcet Nife Guilds</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #131 on:</b> June 06, 2005, 01:23:53 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Today 5th June 2005 at approximately 11:00pm Australian time, Cold Fury completed the last trial it needed to enter Anguish. <br /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/banghead2.gif" alt="banghead2" border="0" /><br /><br /><b>COLD FURY IS IN ANGUISH NOW!</b><br /><br />This is a significant first for us. I believe we are the only Australian guild server-wide to be Anguish flagged (and also the only guild in this particular time-zone to be flagged).<br /><br />So now I think there are 4 guilds on Quellious(Rodcet Nife) thats Anguish flagged.<br />Ref: <a href="http://www.cold-fury.net" target="_blank">www.cold-fury.net</a> for screenies.<br />&nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" />&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: June 07, 2005, 04:06:17 pm by Greif</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><b>Cold Fury - Quellious(Rodcet Nife)</b><br /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=217293" target="_blank">Greif the Enchanter</a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
